{"thread":{"threadID":4602,"boardID":166,"topic":"200hp innocent","time":1499357723,"userID":2229,"username":"WHAT","lastPostTime":1499434103,"lastPoster":"WHAT","replies":7,"views":270,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":1,"cumulativeLikes":5},"tags":[{"tagID":1195,"name":"complaint"},{"tagID":1192,"name":"extra hp"},{"tagID":1194,"name":"fix"},{"tagID":1193,"name":"overpowered"},{"tagID":208,"name":"ttt"}],"posts":[{"postID":68493,"threadID":4602,"userID":2229,"username":"WHAT","subject":"200hp innocent","time":1499357723,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":5,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","time":1499357778,"value":1},{"userID":2526,"username":"Burn","time":1499357778,"value":1},{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1499362086,"value":1},{"userID":2335,"username":"Thorin Pikachu","time":1499428588,"value":1},{"userID":2039,"username":"Wario","time":1499448159,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hello there community.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Just wanna make a little complaint about the map &quot;ttt_minecraft_cg13&quot; which there is an overpowered thing you can do even as an Innocent and that is you can get 200 or more on this map in the most simple way ever.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>As you can see in this imgur I did 155 damage to player sniper( <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2535-sniper-rayleigh/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Sniper Rayleigh</a> ) and he was still left with 45 hp. In my opinion it kinda breaks TTT in a way when someone can just walk around with 200+ hp and if you are less traitors it&#x27;s going to be so much harder</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://imgur.com/a/MvgXX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>I just want other people&#x27;s opinion and if they are the same as me then I (or we) want this to be fixed in one way or another.<br>If not then I&#x27;ll stay out of it</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Thanks!</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":68494,"threadID":4602,"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","subject":"","time":1499357875,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1499362098,"value":1},{"userID":1786,"username":"Syndicate","time":1499514479,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>I agree with you that this 200+ hp does get overpowered and annoying especially if you damage the person for 150 hp + new players might find this overpowered and just leave as they might not find this fun at all.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":68496,"threadID":4602,"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","subject":"","time":1499359826,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1499362118,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>hello</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>I do agree with this, it actually does break the game-play Sometimes , my suggestion would be fixing the map by removing the feature that can give you extra hp so easy or just replace the map with a better one.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>I hope we also get some other feedback&#x27;s on this thread so we know some other opinion and point of views.<br><br>best regards</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Mason</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p> <span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":68499,"threadID":4602,"userID":1153,"username":"Schockly","subject":"","time":1499360132,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2229,"username":"WHAT","time":1499362078,"value":1},{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1499362127,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1825-nachtfrische/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Nachtfrische</a> know this secret and said me he try to delete this <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>This map is not fair because 200hp + Speed and the infinitely Taser</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":68507,"threadID":4602,"userID":2535,"username":"Sniper Rayleigh","subject":"","time":1499361360,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1499362146,"value":1},{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1499392153,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>I won so many rounds as the traitor on that map, its not like the traitor cant take that extra hp as an advantage too <span class=\"missing-media\">[^^]</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>The only thing you have to do as the traitor is to set a hurt station right next to the place where you get extra hp /kill everyone who is there and the problem is solved, because no guy other than you will get it...</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>In my opinion the map is more traitor sided, you just need to know how to use some traitor advantages like hurt stations, bombs,...</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":68583,"threadID":4602,"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","subject":"","time":1499425171,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":4,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1153,"username":"Schockly","time":1499425316,"value":1},{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1499425651,"value":1},{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1499425844,"value":1},{"userID":2229,"username":"WHAT","time":1499434021,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>Schockly</strong></cite><p><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1825-nachtfrische/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Nachtfrische</a> know this secret and said me he try to delete this <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>This map is not fair because 200hp + Speed and the infinitely Taser<b